WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.933 --> 00:00:01.934
♪ ("L'ARLESIENNE SUITE NO. 2"
PLAYS) ♪

00:00:02.034 --> 00:00:03.870
Donald, there's some things
I really need

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:05.071
to speak to you about.

00:00:05.538 --> 00:00:09.842
<i> First, I have a question,
and it's a very normal question.</i>

00:00:09.942 --> 00:00:11.411
<i> Are you wearing a wire?</i>

00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:16.048
Like any lady with a baby,
I need to know where's...

00:00:16.148 --> 00:00:17.751
-The changing room?
-...the bar?

00:00:19.118 --> 00:00:21.820
Do you need
one of my special massages?

00:00:21.921 --> 00:00:23.590
That gets a big, two thumbs up.

00:00:23.857 --> 00:00:24.890
Oh, yeah.

00:00:24.990 --> 00:00:26.459
We could try that as well.

00:00:27.426 --> 00:00:29.929
Angela, I thought we had
something special.

00:00:30.029 --> 00:00:30.996
<i> Nein.</i>

00:00:31.363 --> 00:00:34.234
Your intellect is matched
only by your sensuality.

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:35.635
Ooh.

00:00:38.804 --> 00:00:40.506
Definitely an infestation.

00:00:40.606 --> 00:00:42.341
-Oh, no!
-Hipsters.

00:00:42.442 --> 00:00:45.311
Can't you put some poison down
or something?

00:00:46.245 --> 00:00:48.314
-WOMAN: Dame Judy Dench.
-What can we do for you?

00:00:48.414 --> 00:00:50.549
I'd like a tattoo
that will do me credit

00:00:50.649 --> 00:00:53.086
when I'm skinny dipping
in Saint-Tropez.

00:00:53.186 --> 00:00:56.589
Or flashing from the royal box
at the Albert Hall.

00:00:56.923 --> 00:00:58.058
(IMITATES TRAIN)

00:00:58.891 --> 00:00:59.826
(COUGHS)

00:01:00.793 --> 00:01:02.395
♪ (SUITE TEMPO INCREASES) ♪

00:01:02.629 --> 00:01:04.197
For the love of God!

00:01:05.931 --> 00:01:07.267
(SCREAMS)

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:09.669 line:0%
♪ (SUITE CONCLUDES) ♪

